      "description": "Flat document surface shared by generated reports and empty states.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-paper\"><div class=\"ds-empty\"><h2>Your team’s week, in one place</h2><p>Select a date range and generate a report. Work is grouped by project and employee, with missing submissions and external blockers made visible.</p><p class=\"ds-muted\">Reports reflect progress submitted through Codex.</p></div></section>",
